{
  "uid": "homelab-jmusicbot",
  "title": "jmusicbot — Health & Usage",
  "description": "Kubernetes-visible health, resource use, audio-related network activity, and logs for jmusicbot and its release-notifier. The patched bot exposes an in-cluster /health endpoint used by Kubernetes readiness and Kuma; it does not expose Prometheus application metrics.",
  "tags": ["homelab", "k3s", "jmusicbot"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [
    { "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS", "label": "Prometheus", "type": "datasource", "query": "prometheus", "current": { "selected": true, "text": "Prometheus", "value": "Prometheus" }, "hide": 0, "refresh": 1, "regex": "", "skipUrlSync": false },
    { "name": "DS_LOKI", "label": "Loki", "type": "datasource", "query": "loki", "current": { "selected": true, "text": "Loki", "value": "Loki" }, "hide": 0, "refresh": 1, "regex": "", "skipUrlSync": false }
  ] },
  "panels": [
    { "type": "row", "title": "Kubernetes-visible health", "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }, "panels": [] },
    { "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "What this dashboard can show", "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 }, "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "The patched jmusicbot image exposes an in-cluster `/health` endpoint; Kubernetes readiness and Kuma use it. There is still **no Prometheus exporter**, so Discord guild counts, queue length, current track, and YouTube/LavaPlayer state are not available as time series. The panels below use truthful Kubernetes, cAdvisor, network, and Loki signals. **The music-bot readiness stat deliberately excludes the independent release notifier**, so a healthy notifier can never mask a failed bot deployment." } },
    { "id": 2, "type": "table", "title": "Pod Status", "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 10, "x": 0, "y": 4 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"jmusicbot\"} == 1) * on(namespace, pod) group_left(label_app_kubernetes_io_name) kube_pod_labels{namespace=\"jmusicbot\"}", "format": "table", "instant": true }, { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum by (pod) (kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"jmusicbot\"})", "format": "table", "instant": true }], "transformations": [{ "id": "joinByField", "options": { "byField": "pod", "mode": "outer" } }, { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "Time 1": true, "Time 2": true, "__name__": true, "job": true, "instance": true, "namespace": true, "uid": true, "Value #A": true, "pod": true }, "renameByName": { "label_app_kubernetes_io_name": "Pod", "phase": "Phase", "Value #B": "Restarts" }, "indexByName": {} } }], "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm", "footer": { "show": false, "reducer": ["sum"], "countRows": false, "fields": "" } }, "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" } } }, "overrides": [] } },
    { "id": 3, "type": "stat", "title": "Restarts (24h)", "description": "All containers in the jmusicbot namespace. Any persistent increase warrants checking the log panel.", "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 7, "x": 10, "y": 4 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum(increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"jmusicbot\"}[24h])) or vector(0)", "legendFormat": "restarts" }], "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto" }, "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "#EAB839", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 2 }] } }, "overrides": [] } },
    { "id": 4, "type": "stat", "title": "Music Bot Deployment Ready", "description": "Available replicas for deployment/jmusicbot only. The release notifier is a separate deployment and cannot keep this panel green while the bot is unavailable. Missing series become an explicit red zero.", "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 7, "x": 17, "y": 4 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "max(kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", deployment=\"jmusicbot\"}) or vector(0)", "legendFormat": "available" }], "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto" }, "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } }, "overrides": [] } },
    { "type": "row", "title": "Resource usage", "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 11 }, "panels": [] },
    { "id": 5, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Memory vs Limit — jmusicbot / release-notifier", "description": "Solid cAdvisor working set, dashed configured limit, dotted request. The bot has a 1Gi limit; release-notifier has a 128Mi limit.", "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum by (container) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})", "legendFormat": "{{container}} working set" }, { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum by (container) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", resource=\"memory\"})", "legendFormat": "{{container}} LIMIT" }, { "refId": "C", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum by (container) (kube_pod_container_resource_requests{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", resource=\"memory\"})", "legendFormat": "{{container}} request" }], "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }, "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false } }, "overrides": [] } },
    { "id": 6, "type": "timeseries", "title": "CPU Usage vs Limit (cores)", "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum by (container) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{container}} usage" }, { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum by (container) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", resource=\"cpu\"})", "legendFormat": "{{container}} LIMIT" }], "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }, "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "min": 0, "decimals": 3, "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false, "axisLabel": "cores" } }, "overrides": [] } },
    { "type": "row", "title": "Audio and runtime signals", "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 }, "panels": [] },
    { "id": 7, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Container Network I/O (audio traffic proxy)", "description": "JMusicBot does not expose track/queue metrics. Network throughput is the closest truthful proxy for active Discord/audio and source traffic; it is not a track counter.", "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (pod, container) (rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", pod!=\"\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{pod}}/{{container}} receive" }, { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (pod, container) (rate(container_network_transmit_bytes_total{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", pod!=\"\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{pod}}/{{container}} transmit" }], "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "Bps" }, "overrides": [] } },
    { "id": 8, "type": "timeseries", "title": "CPU Throttling", "description": "Sustained throttling can cause audio stalls even when total CPU usage looks moderate.", "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (container) (rate(container_cpu_cfs_throttled_seconds_total{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{container}} throttled seconds/s" }], "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] } },
    { "id": 9, "type": "stat", "title": "Last Termination: OOMKilled", "description": "Containers whose most recent termination reason was OOMKilled. This can remain nonzero after recovery; inspect logs and the restart panel for timing.", "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 30 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", reason=\"OOMKilled\"}) or vector(0)", "legendFormat": "OOMKilled" }], "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }, "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] } }, "overrides": [] } },
    { "id": 12, "type": "stat", "title": "Containers Waiting / Pull Failures", "description": "Current Kubernetes waiting states across the namespace. The second value isolates ImagePullBackOff, ErrImagePull, invalid images, and container-config failures—the states that produce no application logs because the process never starts.", "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 18, "x": 6, "y": 30 }, "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{namespace=\"jmusicbot\"} == 1) or vector(0)", "legendFormat": "all waiting" }, { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum(kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{namespace=\"jmusicbot\", reason=~\"ImagePullBackOff|ErrImagePull|CreateContainerConfigError|InvalidImageName\"} == 1) or vector(0)", "legendFormat": "image/config failures" }], "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "orientation": "horizontal", "textMode": "value_and_name", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto" }, "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] } }, "overrides": [] } },
    { "type": "row", "title": "Logs", "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 37 }, "panels": [] },
    { "id": 11, "type": "stat", "title": "Log Lines (24h)", "description": "Independent Loki ingestion check. A nonzero count proves the logs exist even when the raw panel is filtered or the bot has been quiet during the dashboard's selected range. FIXED 2026-09-21 (two issues): (1) this and the panel below hardcoded datasource uid \"Loki\" instead of the ${DS_LOKI} template variable this dashboard already defines but never used here -- works today only because that happens to be the datasource's real UID. (2) there is no `namespace` Loki label any more -- Alloy's current pipeline only produces __stream_shard__/instance/job/level/service_name; pod identity now lives in `instance` = \"namespace/podname:container\".", "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 5, "x": 0, "y": 38 }, "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" }, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum(count_over_time({instance=~\"jmusicbot/.*\"}[24h])) or vector(0)", "queryType": "instant" }], "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "none", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto" }, "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 }, "overrides": [] } },
    { "id": 10, "type": "logs", "title": "jmusicbot and Release Notifier Logs (last 24h)", "description": "Raw application logs with a panel-level 24-hour lookback. JMusicBot is normally quiet after startup, so a five-minute dashboard range can correctly contain no lines; this panel intentionally keeps enough history visible. Image-pull/config failures appear in the Kubernetes panels above because a container that never starts cannot emit application logs.", "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 19, "x": 5, "y": 38 }, "timeFrom": "24h", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" }, "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" }, "editorMode": "code", "expr": "{instance=~\"jmusicbot/.*\"}", "queryType": "range", "maxLines": 2000 }], "options": { "showTime": true, "showLabels": true, "showCommonLabels": false, "wrapLogMessage": true, "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none", "sortOrder": "Descending" }, "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] } }
  ]
}
